8790373", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823310_4748015132123706_6881012692234360039_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AdRK0jynzzEQ7kNvwHuZq0n&_nc_oc=AdqVNQyn3I0ig4Ktwh4mdqM27mY9MOxiUEuV1FVXcALjqzDiZCHMhZk0r491CtC1e5k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXxpXuL8u-zmwrepc277NAcs62QHLGIpic7Wohv-yMw3g&oe=6B0F1C00"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "1662046328908451", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825345_1662046332241784_2345509644852012824_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QR4iocVtDC4Q7kNvwF6VHtV&_nc_oc=AdqSG0yjoZ5X8uED5OvKcfJPOhfQqqyfoQWX2KAfasji2H2BVWg_n61S7RsuDNORsBg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQVhCoZX8w1-Vkw_SzP5s7exXFw0XIPI8CIv05iHrwTD9A&oe=6B0F17B0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Pawtopia", "keywords": ["dog", "puppy", "pets", "simulator", "animals"], "long_description": "# Welcome to Pawtopia! \ud83d\udc3e\n\nEver wanted a dog of your own? Now you can experience the fun of having a furry best friend in virtual reality!\n\n**Pawtopia** is a playful VR dog simulator where you can raise your very own dog, take care of your companion, and explore a world full of fun activities and adventures.\n\nWhether you're spending time with your pup or heading out to explore, there's always something to enjoy.\n\n**\ud83d\udc36 Raise Your Best Friend**\nTake care of your dog, spend time together, and enjoy the little moments that make having a pet special.\n\n**\ud83c\udfbe Play & Have Fun**\nInteract with your furry companion in VR and enjoy playful activities together.\n\n**\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f Explore the City**\nStep outside and discover the city! Meet different characters, interact with NPCs, and see what adventures await.\n\n**\u2b50 Complete Fun Missions**\nTake on missions and challenges as you explore the world of Pawtopia.\n\n**\u2764\ufe0f A World for Dog Lovers**\nWhether you're a lifelong dog lover or just looking for a fun and relaxing VR experience, Pawtopia gives you a little companion to call your own.\n\n**Your dog. Your adventures. Your Pawtopia. \ud83d\udc3e**", "short_description": "Meet your new best friend in Pawtopia! \ud83d\udc36 Raise and care for your very own dog in virtual reality. Play together, explore the city, meet fun characters, and complete exciting missions. From everyday pet care to little adventures, there's always something to do with your furry companion!"}]}, "developer_name": "Knockout Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://knockoutgames.xyz/privacy/pawtopia.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Knockout Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://knockoutgames.xyz/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "1990104051447093"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1715974186131149"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2182002726199540"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2182002726199540"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1794863160, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2182002726199540"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"no